      "structuredContent": {
        "url": "https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/pull/5802",
        "number": 5802,
        "state": "open",
        "merged": false,
        "mergeable": false,
        "draft": true,
        "body": "Some development fits reached the original epoch cap while still improving. The cap cannot be used as evidence of convergence.\n\nThis separately recorded phase restores the last complete epoch, complete model configuration, optimizer, Torch RNG, sample-order RNG, update count and plateau state. It preserves the prior best checkpoint until a strict improvement, retains the original diagnostic, and charges startup and all new work against the parent's original actual wall ceiling. It cannot resume a partial batch or silently add a learning rate, seed or fresh diagnostic.\n\nC1 is an extension introduced after capped runs were observed. Its added optimization steps and controller/preflight costs remain visible. The native controller must pass each original outer hard_wall_seconds value, which can be less than the nominal four hours because of the original global deadline. Native C1 has not been dispatched.\n\nValidation: the frozen C1 capsule passed all 24 combined core/continuation tests with source unchanged. Five cores matched split and uninterrupted complete state exactly on synthetic fixtures. Numerical and scientific admission remain HOLD. Full tree equals local commit b6f05399f31fc73b42b79042d7a3aafbfd059192.",
